# Files that must never be uploaded to Vercel (and so never served publicly).
# Vercel serves this whole folder as a static site, so anything not listed
# here can be downloaded by anyone who guesses its name. Nothing the site or
# api/ reads at runtime is excluded (products.json, product-images.json,
# strain-db.json, branches.json, lab-db.json, food-menu.json stay).

# Secrets — real values live only in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Internal notes, AI handover/prompt files and working spreadsheets.
*.md
*.csv
*.py
*.sql

# Development-only folders.
tests/
docs/
supabase/
archive/
.claude/
node_modules/
